The visual mesh roqsim_sensors/models/d455/meshes/d455.obj is converted (binary STL -> OBJ, scaled
mm -> m and decimated to ~6k triangles for real-time rendering) from d455.stl in:

    https://github.com/IntelRealSense/realsense-ros
    (realsense2_description/meshes/d455.stl)

