The STL is exported in its native frame (identity axes: x = the ~124 mm long bar the sensors are
arrayed across, y = height ~29 mm, z = depth ~26 mm with the front glass at z=0 and +z the lens
outward normal), which already matches the d435/d415 mesh convention -- no reorientation was applied.

The `d455_color` camera offset baked into roqsim_sensors/models/d455/d455.xml is derived from the same
repository's realsense2_description/urdf/_d455.urdf.xacro (the color-optical-frame transform, mapped
from the URDF link frame into this mesh-local frame), not measured off the mesh directly.
